{
  "era": "wotlk",
  "format": "living-azeroth-npc-summaries",
  "map": 647,
  "npcs": [
    {
      "entry": 34715,
      "name": "Sky-Captain \"Dusty\" Blastnut",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:34715:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:3e5cd7127db9433f91b44ed7",
            "source:e1f1f1d2ddc7de353e25e4e4",
            "source:a4d808c7974e7cfb298225b3",
            "source:03e2d86a9885306012522e51",
            "source:51f36162e34ad6af14ff6696",
            "source:af81676317fbafbeb5c9f468"
          ],
          "text": "Sky-Captain “Dusty” Blastnut commands the Zephyr on its flights between Orgrimmar and Thunder Bluff. He speaks to the crew as “boys,” calls passengers aboard for the ride, and comments on its smooth passage, dry air, and smell of oil. His departure and docking calls give him a brisk, familiar manner as he keeps the airship moving along its route.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 34715
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Zephyr"
    },
    {
      "entry": 34717,
      "name": "Crewman Pipewrench",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:34717:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:8afdbafbb6aadb0194b00c2c",
            "source:e5db2debb318de5ce4d396f2",
            "source:fcb35d9791cedfff1e0a6589"
          ],
          "text": "Crewman Pipewrench serves aboard the Zephyr. His passenger remarks describe the ride as smooth despite the dust, warn people to keep away from the edge, and remind them that he is working. He comes across as practical and attentive to safety while going about his duties.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 34717
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Zephyr"
    },
    {
      "entry": 34718,
      "name": "Crewman Deadbolt",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:34718:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:63bb2a5ba044b0a5683dfa43",
            "source:277644559dcecdac2d9d0be9",
            "source:eeddb9258a5fcdaf96dc0c8c"
          ],
          "text": "Crewman Deadbolt serves aboard the Zephyr. In his brief reply, he says he is on break, giving him a curt, work-paused air.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 34718
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Zephyr"
    },
    {
      "entry": 34719,
      "name": "Crewman Grit",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:34719:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:85dd6c8a7aa99d6458b1de7c",
            "source:346450a84d24f833dbb595a9"
          ],
          "text": "Crewman Grit serves aboard the Zephyr.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 34719
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Zephyr"
    },
    {
      "entry": 34721,
      "name": "Chief Officer Ograh",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:34721:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:6bdf80caa69e4056edcf65c9",
            "source:68fb487cc2ea3146e5fff66a",
            "source:2b0a34b2cf281e6f4a659d3a",
            "source:0fc31ce929d27a43068adb07",
            "source:d0dd755d3ea4ec353e735e9b",
            "source:8e3a98ec78545214111eaed5"
          ],
          "text": "Chief Officer Ograh helps direct the Zephyr's flights, pressing Zippik to get moving and urging him to steer carefully. He watches the schedule and calls out the direction the ship must take, sounding sharp and impatient when the crew falls behind. He also openly doubts Zippik's piloting, claiming he would steer them into the Bluff without Ograh's oversight.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 34721
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Zephyr"
    },
    {
      "entry": 34723,
      "name": "Watcher Tolwe",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:34723:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:9731bcc020f225308a084fc0",
            "source:606005370eab5ab344b3ac26",
            "source:c93dca726ec8a0cdf34a43c4",
            "source:ada65156afc67374b965b5c7",
            "source:c61d855bb99f887973480232",
            "source:ab9eba99f6dbfbd2bbdf3b8e",
            "source:430dfa2cc9278df5a662c588"
          ],
          "text": "Watcher Tolwe says his job aboard the Zephyr is to keep the peace and watch. He turns his attention to clouds, bugs, and birds, sometimes reacting to ordinary sights as if they were more dramatic: a cloud resembles the Warchief to him, and he briefly mistakes a bird for a harpy. His watchfulness is curious but easily diverted.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 34723
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Zephyr"
    },
    {
      "entry": 34730,
      "name": "Navigator Zippik",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:34730:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:d05d6a2da861b04695a4d7fb",
            "source:e943d3bf3d46da0814a3c82c",
            "source:439005468ef77a24e256d3bd"
          ],
          "text": "Navigator Zippik is a named figure associated with the Zephyr. He complains that a big green harpy is making him go deaf, then insists he knows how to drive his craft and is no idiot. His irritation is paired with confidence in his piloting.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 34730
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "The Zephyr"
    }
  ],
  "place": "Transport: Orgrimmar to Thunder Bluff",
